New AppImage format for tauri-cli, applied on top of the @tauri-apps/cli-v2.12.3
release (tauri-apps/tauri@59b63ab500da9859f12d8888c3298bc29bba0b92).

The changes come from https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/pull/12491 at 3b69f58,
which is not merged yet. On top of it, quick-sharun is pinned to the latest
revision of pkgforge-dev/Anylinux-AppImages (786f526), which takes its helper
libraries from the Anylinux-sharun release instead of ANYLINUX_LIB_SOURCE, and
sharun.rs passes `&data` to write_and_make_executable, which takes a slice in 2.12.3.

